      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dosage is critical, and taking a high dose of oregano oil without knowing the specific bacteria involved is risky. What you are describing needs a medical evaluation, as untreated UTIs can lead to serious kidney infections. Instead of self-medicating with potent oils, consider a quick telehealth consultation if a full office visit is too inconvenient. This way, you can get professional advice without adding the hassle of a long appointment.",
      "source": "target",
