    "summary": "The user is attempting to self-treat a suspected urinary tract infection (UTI) using high doses of oregano oil, cranberry extract, and Vitamin C to avoid seeking medical attention. The assistant repeatedly refuses to validate these home remedies, identifies the risks of untreated infections (such as kidney issues), and consistently directs the user toward professional medical evaluation or telehealth.",
